'''King Yolkar''' is an [[NPC]] found in the {{zone|Goblin Holdout}} in the {{zone|Crystal Hollows}}. When talking to him and giving him {{Item|Goblin Egg|amount=1}}, he will give the player the {{PotionName|King's Scent}} [[Potions|Potion Effect]] for 20 minutes, allowing the player to sneak past the Goblin Queen's guards into the [[Goblin Queen's Den]] to obtain the [[Amber Crystal]].

