== Trivia ==
*'''King Yolkar'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s name may be based off of the word [[w:Yolk|yolk]], the inner part of an egg, which may explain his constant hunger for Goblin Eggs.
*The {{PotionName|King's Scent}} effect can be toggled on and off using [[Booster Cookie]].
*The {{PotionName|King's Scent}} effect will disappear when a player with this effect goes into water in the [[Crystal Hollows]].
**Touching water with the {{PotionName|King's Scent}} effect outside the Crystal Hollows will not remove the effect.
* Water in the Crystal Hollows indicates that King Yolkar is nearby, so players can search accordingly.

